{"book":"Judges","chapter":12,"entries":[{"id":6870,"title":"Judges 12:1","segments":["¶And the men of Ephraim gathered themselves together, and went northward, and said unto Jephthah, Wherefore passedst thou over to fight against the children of Ammon, and didst not call us to go with thee? we will burn thine house upon thee with fire. {gathered...: Heb. were called}"],"ref":"Judges 12:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶And the men","strong":"H376"},{"text":" of Ephraim","strong":"H669"},{"text":" gathered themselves together","strong":"H6817"},{"text":", and went","strong":"H5674"},{"text":" northward","strong":"H6828"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto Jephthah","strong":"H3316"},{"text":", Wherefore passedst thou over","strong":"H5674"},{"text":" to fight","strong":"H3898"},{"text":" against the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ammon","strong":"H5983"},{"text":", and didst not call","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" us to go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":" with thee? we will burn","strong":"H8313"},{"text":" thine house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" upon thee with fire","strong":"H784"},{"text":". {gathered...: Heb. were called}"}]},{"id":6871,"title":"Judges 12:2","segments":["And Jephthah said unto them, I and my people were at great strife with the children of Ammon; and when I called you, ye delivered me not out of their hands."],"ref":"Judges 12:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And Jephthah","strong":"H3316"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto them, I and my people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" were","strong":"H1961"},{"text":" at great","strong":"H3966"},{"text":" strife","strong":"H376"},{"text":"","strong":"H7379"},{"text":" with the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ammon","strong":"H5983"},{"text":"; and when I called","strong":"H2199"},{"text":" you, ye delivered","strong":"H3467"},{"text":" me not out of their hands","strong":"H3027"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6872,"title":"Judges 12:3","segments":["And when I saw that ye delivered [me] not, I put my life in my hands, and passed over against the children of Ammon, and the LORD delivered them into my hand: wherefore then are ye come up unto me this day, to fight against me?"],"ref":"Judges 12:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"And when I saw","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" that ye delivered","strong":"H3467"},{"text":" [me] not, I put","strong":"H7760"},{"text":" my life","strong":"H5315"},{"text":" in my hands","strong":"H3709"},{"text":", and passed over","strong":"H5674"},{"text":" against the children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Ammon","strong":"H5983"},{"text":", and the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" delivered","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" them into my hand","strong":"H3027"},{"text":": wherefore then are ye come up","strong":"H5927"},{"text":" unto me this day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":", to fight","strong":"H3898"},{"text":" against me?"}]},{"id":6873,"title":"Judges 12:4","segments":["Then Jephthah gathered together all the men of Gilead, and fought with Ephraim: and the men of Gilead smote Ephraim, because they said, Ye Gileadites [are] fugitives of Ephraim among the Ephraimites, [and] among the Manassites."],"ref":"Judges 12:4","verse":4,"words":[{"text":"Then Jephthah","strong":"H3316"},{"text":" gathered together","strong":"H6908"},{"text":" all the men","strong":"H582"},{"text":" of Gilead","strong":"H1568"},{"text":", and fought","strong":"H3898"},{"text":" with Ephraim","strong":"H669"},{"text":": and the men","strong":"H582"},{"text":" of Gilead","strong":"H1568"},{"text":" smote","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" Ephraim","strong":"H669"},{"text":", because they said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Ye Gileadites","strong":"H1568"},{"text":" [are] fugitives","strong":"H6412"},{"text":" of Ephraim","strong":"H669"},{"text":" among","strong":"H8432"},{"text":" the Ephraimites","strong":"H669"},{"text":", [and] among","strong":"H8432"},{"text":" the Manassites","strong":"H4519"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6874,"title":"Judges 12:5","segments":["And the Gileadites took the passages of Jordan before the Ephraimites: and it was [so], that when those Ephraimites which were escaped said, Let me go over; that the men of Gilead said unto him, [Art] thou an Ephraimite? If he said, Nay;"],"ref":"Judges 12:5","verse":5,"words":[{"text":"And the Gileadites","strong":"H1568"},{"text":" took","strong":"H3920"},{"text":" the passages","strong":"H4569"},{"text":" of Jordan","strong":"H3383"},{"text":" before the Ephraimites","strong":"H669"},{"text":": and it was [so], that when those Ephraimites","strong":"H669"},{"text":" which were escaped","strong":"H6412"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Let me go over","strong":"H5674"},{"text":"; that the men","strong":"H582"},{"text":" of Gilead","strong":"H1568"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto him, [Art] thou an Ephraimite","strong":"H673"},{"text":"? If he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Nay;"}]},{"id":6875,"title":"Judges 12:6","segments":["Then said they unto him, Say now Shibboleth: and he said Sibboleth: for he could not frame to pronounce [it] right. Then they took him, and slew him at the passages of Jordan: and there fell at that time of the Ephraimites forty and two thousand."],"ref":"Judges 12:6","verse":6,"words":[{"text":"Then said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" they unto him, Say","strong":"H559"},{"text":" now Shibboleth","strong":"H7641"},{"text":": and he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" Sibboleth","strong":"H5451"},{"text":": for he could not frame","strong":"H3559"},{"text":" to pronounce","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" [it] right","strong":"H3559"},{"text":". Then they took","strong":"H270"},{"text":" him, and slew","strong":"H7819"},{"text":" him at the passages","strong":"H4569"},{"text":" of Jordan","strong":"H3383"},{"text":": and there fell","strong":"H5307"},{"text":" at that time","strong":"H6256"},{"text":" of the Ephraimites","strong":"H669"},{"text":" forty","strong":"H705"},{"text":" and two","strong":"H8147"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6876,"title":"Judges 12:7","segments":["And Jephthah judged Israel six years. Then died Jephthah the Gileadite, and was buried in [one of] the cities of Gilead."],"ref":"Judges 12:7","verse":7,"words":[{"text":"And Jephthah","strong":"H3316"},{"text":" judged","strong":"H8199"},{"text":" Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" six","strong":"H8337"},{"text":" years","strong":"H8141"},{"text":". Then died","strong":"H4191"},{"text":" Jephthah","strong":"H3316"},{"text":" the Gileadite","strong":"H1569"},{"text":", and was buried","strong":"H6912"},{"text":" in [one of] the cities","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" of Gilead","strong":"H1568"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6877,"title":"Judges 12:8","segments":["¶And after him Ibzan of Bethlehem judged Israel."],"ref":"Judges 12:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"¶And after","strong":"H310"},{"text":" him Ibzan","strong":"H78"},{"text":" of Bethlehem","strong":"H1035"},{"text":" judged","strong":"H8199"},{"text":" Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6878,"title":"Judges 12:9","segments":["And he had thirty sons, and thirty daughters, [whom] he sent abroad, and took in thirty daughters from abroad for his sons. And he judged Israel seven years."],"ref":"Judges 12:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"And he had thirty","strong":"H7970"},{"text":" sons","strong":"H1121"},{"text":", and thirty","strong":"H7970"},{"text":" daughters","strong":"H1323"},{"text":", [whom] he sent","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" abroad","strong":"H2351"},{"text":", and took","strong":"H935"},{"text":" in thirty","strong":"H7970"},{"text":" daughters","strong":"H1323"},{"text":" from abroad","strong":"H2351"},{"text":" for his sons","strong":"H1121"},{"text":". And he judged","strong":"H8199"},{"text":" Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" seven","strong":"H7651"},{"text":" years","strong":"H8141"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":6879,"title":"Judges 12:10","segments":["Then died Ibzan, and was buried at Bethlehem."],"ref":"J